    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "id": "kK1yh",
      "x": -1879,
      "y": -1522,
      "name": "Prompt",
      "width": 1140,
      "height": 775,
      "content": "You are designing a new page inside the file `designs/soi.pen` for MindWell Healthcare (Sphinx brand).\n\n## MANDATORY: Read the Design System First\n\nBefore designing ANYTHING, you MUST read these two reference frames:\n\n1. **\"Sphinx Deisgn Tokens\"** (frame `dNnQC`) — the authoritative source for ALL visual decisions\n2. **\"Sphinx Shadcn Components\"** (frame `IDlua`) — the component library showcasing every available pattern\n\n## Page Design Instruction\n**Page Name**\n\n\n\n**Page Functionality**\n\n\n\n**Page Layout Instruction**\n\n\n\n## Page-Specific Components Rule\n\n**If the new page requires custom components that don't exist in \"Sphinx Shadcn Components\":**\n\n1. Create a NEW frame next to the page frame named `\"[Page Name] Components\"`\n2. Build each page-specific component inside this frame with `reusable: true`\n3. Include a title text: \"[Page Name] Components\" in Outfit 22px bold\n4. Then use `type: \"ref\"` instances of those components in the actual page\n\n**Example structure:**\n[Page Name] Components (frame, reusable components defined here) \n[Page Name] (frame, the actual page using refs from above)"
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "eucRw",
      "x": 7274,
      "y": -152,
      "name": "Assessment Questionaire Components",
      "theme": {
